          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The item-not-received claim",
            "body": "<p>Always use tracked postage, even when it costs a little more, and keep the proof of postage. Untracked parcels are where sellers lose disputes they should have won.</p>"
          }
        },
